<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="he">

<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<style>
		body {
			font-family: sans-serif;
			background-color: #f0f1ed;
		}

		div.download-container {
			width: 100%;
			margin-top: 10%;
			text-align: center;
		}

		p {
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: 24px;
		}

		p.small-text {
			font-size: 18px;
		}

		a.no-underline {
			text-decoration: none;
			border: none;
		}
	</style>
</head>

<body>
	<div class="download-container" style="visibility: hidden">
		<a class="no-underline" href="https://archive.gis-net.co.il/Herzeliya/files/scener/srika/archiv/2010-2030/20130304/20130304_22.pdf" title="הורדה">
			<img src="/handasi2016/images/dl-icon.gif" alt="תמונה של חץ מצביע כלפי מטה">
		</a>
		<br>
		<p>הקובץ נשלח להורדה</p>
		<p class="small-text">במידה ולא, ניתן <a class="download-link" href="https://archive.gis-net.co.il/Herzeliya/files/scener/srika/archiv/2010-2030/20130304/20130304_22.pdf">ללחוץ כאן</a> להורדה חוזרת
		</p>
	</div>
    <script>
        setTimeout(function () {
            document.getElementsByClassName('download-container')[0].style.visibility = 'visible';
        }, 1000);
        window.location.href = "https://archive.gis-net.co.il/Herzeliya/files/scener/srika/archiv/2010-2030/20130304/20130304_22.pdf";
    </script>
</body>

</html>